<p>Four hundredths of a second sounds like nothing, but in a class where 22 players broke 4.40, a 4.48 doesn't stand out. Adjusted for weight, his speed score lands around 102, which is roughly average. Nothing about the stopwatch said "record-setting rookie."</p>
